GCC runtime restoration

These files derive from GCC 2.95.2, copyright the Free Software Foundation
and the authors credited in each file. Source URLs and hashes are recorded
in config/GR8E69/libgcc-source.json. COPYING is the unmodified GNU GPL v2.
The special runtime-linking exception is preserved in libgcc2.c itself.

Local modifications, made with AI assistance, annotate the observed .sdata2
placement of each private __clz_tab lookup table. tconfig.h is a local
target configuration selecting 32-bit big-endian PowerPC, 64-bit long double,
no libc dependencies and the upstream portable C arithmetic macros.
Unselected runtime functions and inline assembly branches are not built or
credited. See docs/Libgcc.md for the accepted profile and evidence.
